his Costco membership card.

00:06:06.767 --> 00:06:08.133
Check this out.

00:06:08.133 --> 00:06:09.934
-That was Raymie Styons

00:06:09.934 --> 00:06:12.067
who got the foot stepped on,
Bill Covington...

00:06:12.067 --> 00:06:16.133
[ Laughter ]

00:06:16.133 --> 00:06:18.701
-He was like -- He was like,
"Yeah, I don't want to brag,

00:06:18.701 --> 00:06:21.234
but I can buy 64 rolls
