that part of an ear bud

00:06:35.133 --> 00:06:37.200
had been stuck in his ear
for five years.

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:38.567
[ Audience "Ohhs" ]

00:06:38.567 --> 00:06:40.567
After doctors removed it,
he was like, "Thanks.

00:06:40.567 --> 00:06:43.601
I've had that song
stuck in my head since 2017."

00:06:43.601 --> 00:06:45.067
And finally, in Arizona,

00:06:45.067 --> 00:06:46.801
two teachers
who are husband and wife

00:06:46.801 --> 00:06:50.801
were fired after students
found their OnlyFans account.

00:06:50.801 --> 00:06:52.501
They would've been sent
to detention,

00:06:52.501 --> 00:06:55.734
but that's actually
how one of their videos started.

00:06:55.734 --> 00:06:57.167
When asked to comment,
they were like,

00:06:57.167 --> 00:06:59.267
"You know, if you paid teachers,
we wouldn't have to do this."

00:07:01.033 --> 00:07:02.834
Guys, I saw that in 2024,

00:07:02.834 --> 00:07:06.033
