they just unveiled their mascot.

00:07:06.033 --> 00:07:09.367
And it is a hat.
Here it is.

00:07:09.367 --> 00:07:12.267
This is it.

00:07:12.267 --> 00:07:13.534
Look, kids, it's a hat,

00:07:13.534 --> 00:07:15.968
