00:07:22.434 --> 00:07:24.901
It looks like
a holiday-themed poop emoji.

00:07:24.901 --> 00:07:27.467
-Oh!

00:07:27.467 --> 00:07:29.667
-Well, speaking of red hats,
everyone is talking about this.

00:07:29.667 --> 00:07:31.367
Earlier tonight,
former president Trump

00:07:31.367 --> 00:07:35.133
officially announced that he's
running for president in 2024.

00:07:35.133 --> 00:07:40.300
[ Audience groans ]
You guys saying "Bruuuce"?

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:41.868
[ As Trump ]
They're saying "Bruuuce."

00:07:41.868 --> 00:07:45.234
Springsteen's on --
Springsteen's on "Fallon."

00:07:45.234 --> 00:07:46.634
[ Normal voice ] Yep, Trump
made the big announcement

00:07:46.634 --> 00:07:48.667
from Mar-a-Lago,
or, as it's also known,

00:07:48.667 --> 00:07:51.267
the summer home of
the National Archives.

00:07:54.234 --> 00:07:56.267
I'm pretty sure this is
the first presidential campaign

00:07:56.267 --> 00:07:59.534
to be kicked off
from an active crime scene.

00:07:59.534 --> 00:08:01.501
Seriously, was the set from
"Dahmer" not available?

00:08:01.501 --> 00:08:02.667
What's...

00:08:02.667 --> 00:08:05.167
[ As Trump ] It's the number-1
show on Netflix.

00:08:05.167 --> 00:08:06.534
[ Normal voice ]
Guys, listen to this.

00:08:06.534 --> 00:08:09.367
Fox News founder Rupert Murdoch
reportedly told Trump

00:08:09.367 --> 00:08:12.801
