for someone younger.

00:08:23.133 --> 00:08:24.868
Yep, Murdoch
is breaking away from Trump,

00:08:24.868 --> 00:08:26.434
so now they're going to set
Sean Hannity

00:08:26.434 --> 00:08:28.634
