and see which one he goes to.

00:08:28.634 --> 00:08:30.400
It's like, "Come here.
Come here, boy.

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:32.834
Come here. Come here, boy!
Come on.

00:08:32.834 --> 00:08:34.868
Remember who raised you."

00:08:34.868 --> 00:08:38.033
That's right -- Trump's running
for president yet again in 2024.

00:08:38.033 --> 00:08:40.267
And Trump says that he's still
at the top of his game,

00:08:40.267 --> 00:08:43.601
feeling sharper than ever and
totally 100% ready to lead...

00:08:43.601 --> 00:08:44.901
-The United Schess.

00:08:44.901 --> 00:08:50.567
-He said that he won't be
slowed down by what happened

00:08:50.567 --> 00:08:51.567
