00:08:58.868 --> 00:09:02.467
-Lawmarkers.
-He wants to fix our broken...

00:09:02.467 --> 00:09:03.634
-Supply chair.

00:09:03.634 --> 00:09:06.167
-And work with
big business leaders like...

00:09:06.167 --> 00:09:07.801
-Tim Apple.

00:09:07.801 --> 00:09:09.234
-He won't be bogged down
by attacks

00:09:09.234 --> 00:09:10.667
