all back to saying...

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:21.033
-Merry Chrissus, everybody.

00:09:21.033 --> 00:09:24.133
-There you go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:24.133 --> 00:09:27.400
Still got it. Close. Almost.

